366768,"w":0.42919387817382815,"h":0.011786446980294629},{"x":0.54466231623462813,"y":0.15112406322793903,"w":0.42701522827148441,"text":"the bus to school because | was feeling too lazy to cycle","h":0.01166663419991909},{"text":"Zuphill \/downhill like | usually did for my regular morning","w":0.42919387817382815,"h":0.013083815673904375,"x":0.54248366556994876,"y":0.16569525391780604},{"x":0.54466232553726879,"text":"exercise. But because it was raining really heavily, a boat","w":0.42919387817382815,"y":0.18151540366483565,"h":0.013322231473771873},{"y":0.19767441887122561,"h":0.013081394961037107,"x":0.54466231623462813,"w":0.42701522827148441,"text":"came along instead. I got on the boat, in fact, I was the only"},{"w":0.4270152282714843,"x":0.54466231600223924,"y":0.21220930304796293,"text":"passenger, and it began to 3cross \/swim the river. But the","h":0.014684951871162033},{"h":0.011814282597550574,"text":"journey was very rough and the captain ordered me to sit","w":0.42919387817382804,"x":0.54466232732557662,"y":0.22965116299849853},{"x":0.5446623171278745,"w":0.4270152282714843,"y":0.24418604654201048,"h":0.01309954891792442,"text":"down and 4close \/ fasten my seatbelt. Then suddenly there"},{"w":0.42483657836914068,"h":0.013081394961037107,"text":"were lots of other boats and we were 5 stuck \/ caught in traffic","x":0.54466232530344694,"y":0.26017441901657445},{"h":0.013322231473771873,"text":"It took ages for the boat to make any progress, and all the","w":0.42701522827148441,"x":0.54466231338785998,"y":0.27601998314983545},{"text":"time it was raining. When I finally arrived at school, I noticed","w":0.42701522827148441,"h":0.011762242233822717,"y":0.29215116315353729,"x":0.54466231623462813},{"text":"I was walking \/going barefoot. And I was completely wet and","y":0.30668604663285359,"w":0.4270152282714843,"h":0.013081394961037107,"x":0.54466232477493326},{"y":0.32264779387713016,"text":"shaking from the cold. The teacher looked confused and ask